#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:1
#: 9f4dbfbfb2fb45df9491ac90268608da
msgid "命令行与脚本运行工作流"
msgstr "Run Workflows from the Command Line or a Script"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:3
#: d007b7f3a4e44bc880340b4fd896879f
msgid "在「生成数据集」页把工作流导出为 JSON 后，可以不开图形界面直接复现整条流程。适合批量重跑、 写进流水线、或者在服务器上生成训练集。"
msgstr ""
"After exporting a workflow as JSON from the Make Dataset page, you can "
"reproduce the whole pipeline without opening the graphical interface. "
"Useful for batch reruns, CI pipelines, or generating training sets on a "
"server."

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:6
#: b71908ad12f7447b87eed1addfb8a36f
msgid "前提"
msgstr "Requirements"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:8
#: 1c8ceb19e6344e928d0fbd9fd5ac36ed
msgid ""
"工作流必须是当前版本导出的 JSON，也就是每张卡片带有 `params` 对象。旧版本导出的扁平格式 "
"（参数直接写在卡片顶层）不支持命令行读取，需要先在界面里打开并重新导出一次。遇到这种文件时 命令行会明确报错，不会静默按默认值运行。"
msgstr ""
"The workflow must be JSON exported by the current version, meaning every "
"card carries a `params` object. The flat layout written by older versions"
" (with parameters at the card's top level) cannot be read from the "
"command line; open it once in the interface and export it again. Such a "
"file produces a clear error instead of silently running with default "
"values."

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:12
#: c2e5ed69006b488cad0667268ea06bd3
msgid "先看会做什么"
msgstr "Preview What Will Happen"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:14
#: fcbe528b69fe474189fd427592350af6
msgid "执行前建议先 `preview`。它只解析 JSON，不产生任何结构："
msgstr ""
"Before running, use `preview`. It only parses the JSON and produces no "
"structures:"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:16
#: a0cdb2e08a5048adbb7d2615642bedaa
msgid "nepkit workflow preview flow.json\n"
msgstr "nepkit workflow preview flow.json\n"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:20
#: 633df7d9d87c4d4ea380d698315dff32
msgid "输出示例："
msgstr "Example output:"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:22
#: 6fde674569ef4d72b897d2c3169ca09e
msgid ""
"workflow: flow.json\n"
"saved by: 3.0.1 (schema 2)\n"
"cards: 5\n"
"\n"
"   1. SuperCellCard    structure\n"
"   2. CardGroup        group\n"
"   3. CellStrainCard   structure\n"
"   4. CellScalingCard  structure\n"
"   5. PerturbCard      structure\n"
"\n"
"input: required\n"
"no structures were produced; use 'run' to execute\n"
msgstr ""
"workflow: flow.json\n"
"saved by: 3.0.1 (schema 2)\n"
"cards: 5\n"
"\n"
"   1. SuperCellCard    structure\n"
"   2. CardGroup        group\n"
"   3. CellStrainCard   structure\n"
"   4. CellScalingCard  structure\n"
"   5. PerturbCard      structure\n"
"\n"
"input: required\n"
"no structures were produced; use 'run' to execute\n"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:37
#: 7155ea3d3a634ea5924ae7e407f98c66
msgid "加上 `-i` 可以看到输入结构数量："
msgstr "Add `-i` to see the input structure count:"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:39
#: 89af6860a301474f84796b7691d1e63a
msgid "nepkit workflow preview flow.json -i input.xyz\n"
msgstr "nepkit workflow preview flow.json -i input.xyz\n"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:43
#: a87ab4f091bf41bc971dcd7b7fdb97c7
msgid "如果工作流是生成型的（例如原型构建卡），`input` 会显示 `not required`，此时 `run` 不需要 `-i`。"
msgstr ""
"If the workflow generates its own structures (for example a prototype "
"builder card), `input` shows `not required` and `run` does not need `-i`."

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:45
#: 85875bc37b96444aaf3b0e6ea2e97ff7
msgid "执行并导出"
msgstr "Run and Export"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:47
#: 75a80aa38a2b41de9f899797974c7a20
msgid "nepkit workflow run flow.json -i input.xyz -o output.xyz\n"
msgstr "nepkit workflow run flow.json -i input.xyz -o output.xyz\n"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:51
#: aa3077e6119b4966b9383673dbb2fe9d
msgid "默认导出**全部卡片**的输出，也就是每一级的结果都会写进同一个文件。这和在界面里用 「查看全部输出」导出的范围一致。"
msgstr ""
"By default every **card** output is exported, so each stage's result "
"lands in the same file. This matches the \"View all outputs\" scope in "
"the interface."

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:54
#: 810df67c013649868859c2fde628c546
msgid "按需只导出某张卡片的结果，用 `--card` 指定卡片类名，可以重复多次："
msgstr ""
"To export only one card's result, pass its class name with `--card`; "
"repeat it for several cards:"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:56
#: d4a71d951aa54f5d9501736c3e20abbd
msgid ""
"nepkit workflow run flow.json -i input.xyz -o only_supercell.xyz --card "
"SuperCellCard\n"
"nepkit workflow run flow.json -i input.xyz -o two_stages.xyz \\\n"
"    --card SuperCellCard --card PerturbCard\n"
msgstr ""
"nepkit workflow run flow.json -i input.xyz -o only_supercell.xyz --card "
"SuperCellCard\n"
"nepkit workflow run flow.json -i input.xyz -o two_stages.xyz \\\n"
"    --card SuperCellCard --card PerturbCard\n"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:62
#: ffaab84f62fa4f3dbc4b0f7c5d89a31a
msgid "卡片类名就是 JSON 里的 `class` 字段，和界面中卡片对应的类一致。"
msgstr ""
"The card class name is the `class` field in the JSON, the same class the "
"card uses in the interface."

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:64
#: dfe8eadcb0ac4952b4c4ed7dd4313817
msgid "输出格式为 extxyz，与界面导出保持一致。`-q` 只打印错误，适合放进脚本。"
msgstr ""
"The output format is extxyz, consistent with the interface. `-q` prints "
"errors only, which suits scripts."

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:66
#: 0373b053b5e44abc952e7f0e1e03ae27
msgid "输出分两路"
msgstr "Two Separate Streams"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:68
#: 3de5d54ea9ed47c4bc362cd54537df23
msgid "结果摘要走标准输出，错误走标准错误，脚本可以直接分开读："
msgstr ""
"The result summary goes to standard output and errors go to standard "
"error, so a script can read each separately:"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:70
#: bea713f286e84fc8b0edf36b41995024
msgid ""
"$ nepkit workflow run flow.json -i input.xyz -o out.xyz\n"
"SuperCellCard        1 in       1 out\n"
"CellStrainCard       1 in      23 out\n"
"total: 1 in, 24 out\n"
"written: out.xyz\n"
msgstr ""
"$ nepkit workflow run flow.json -i input.xyz -o out.xyz\n"
"SuperCellCard        1 in       1 out\n"
"CellStrainCard       1 in      23 out\n"
"total: 1 in, 24 out\n"
"written: out.xyz\n"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:78
#: 6f030116fab8475f96f1314704cab686
msgid "每张卡一行，按执行顺序排列，`in` 是这张卡收到多少结构，`out` 是它产出多少。这样能直接看出 哪一步在扩增、哪一步在过滤："
msgstr ""
"One row per card in execution order: `in` is how many structures the card"
" received and `out` is how many it produced. This shows directly which "
"step expands and which one filters:"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:81
#: 0de2df20f5dc4445a0c4bb094e4b883a
msgid ""
"SuperCellCard         1 in       1 out\n"
"CellStrainCard        1 in    1331 out\n"
"CardGroup             1 in    1381 out\n"
"PerturbCard        1381 in   69050 out\n"
msgstr ""
"SuperCellCard         1 in       1 out\n"
"CellStrainCard        1 in    1331 out\n"
"CardGroup             1 in    1381 out\n"
"PerturbCard        1381 in   69050 out\n"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:88
#: 8657d9376483438e84ec39573b6706c8
msgid "最后一行的 `total` 里，输入数是整条流程的输入，输出数是全部卡片输出之和，通常大于最后一级； 只想看某一级时用 `--card`。"
msgstr ""
"In the closing `total` row the input is the workflow input and the output"
" is the sum of every card output, usually larger than the final stage; "
"use `--card` to see a single stage."

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:91
#: f2269747657b49609e30e6956cbfdfa5
msgid "输出只用 ASCII 字符，所以在 Windows 中文终端（cp936）里不会乱码，也可以直接按空白列拆开："
msgstr ""
"The output uses ASCII only, so it is not garbled in a Windows Chinese "
"console (cp936) and can be split on whitespace:"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:93
#: bb3f0fa31bdc49e1b09faf967ae72077
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"nepkit workflow run flow.json -i input.xyz -o out.xyz | awk '$3==\"in\" "
"{print $1, $5}'\n"
msgstr ""
"nepkit workflow run flow.json -i input.xyz -o out.xyz | awk '$3==\"in\" "
"{print $1, $5}'\n"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:97
#: f3201e26200d4a97aa904e15b30a91a2
msgid "默认情况下标准错误只会出现错误信息，不会混入库内部的计时和调试日志——即使界面里把日志级别 设成了「调试」也一样，因为命令行不以界面设置为准。"
msgstr ""
"By default standard error carries only errors and never the library's "
"timing or debug logs, even when the interface log level is set to "
"\"Debug\": the command line does not follow the interface setting."

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:100
#: c6105e19dba749fbad88238f05fee564
msgid "需要看库内部的诊断信息（例如某张卡的耗时）时加 `-v`："
msgstr "Add `-v` to see library diagnostics such as per-card timings:"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:102
#: a8a7a92dfb2a48d4aca919eccbc9c44b
msgid "nepkit workflow run flow.json -i input.xyz -o out.xyz -v\n"
msgstr "nepkit workflow run flow.json -i input.xyz -o out.xyz -v\n"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:106
#: 92469743dac94c158b856da31aa3cb0a
msgid "此时标准错误会出现类似这样的内容："
msgstr "Standard error then contains lines such as:"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:108
#: a949a9bc17514d84b72e3a18354ca382
msgid ""
"2026-11-05 16:05:01 | DEBUG | NepTrainKit.utils:wrapper:35 - Function "
"'descriptors' executed in 0.0017 seconds\n"
msgstr ""
"2026-11-05 16:05:01 | DEBUG | NepTrainKit.utils:wrapper:35 - Function "
"'descriptors' executed in 0.0017 seconds\n"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md
#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:112
#: 1085bd72d9a6448e8a23d481b5a6aeef 981a39c5711e4a4fb7830c7157406112
msgid "退出码"
msgstr "Exit Codes"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md
#: f504cdadde2f41b99ccde4d061f5971e
msgid "含义"
msgstr "Meaning"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md
#: f9befb027e0942b9808b25812d5240f1
msgid "`0`"
msgstr "`0`"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md
#: 7d5ad8ea675948aaa68b6bfd5f9b2f2d
msgid "成功"
msgstr "Succeeded"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md
#: fbf39ee27ab04981bffd6398d5f13bfa
msgid "`2`"
msgstr "`2`"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md
#: 4141f741bb994ca7a5cc06eb95be3400
msgid "JSON 无法读取、卡片类未知、输入文件不存在，或某张卡片执行失败"
msgstr ""
"The JSON cannot be read, the card class is unknown, the input file does "
"not exist, or a card failed."

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:119
#: a1bd41a442a741969f52843df905411d
msgid "任何一张卡片失败都会立即中止整条流程，并在错误信息里指明是哪张卡，不会输出半成品结果。"
msgstr ""
"Any card failure aborts the whole pipeline immediately and the message "
"names the failing card; no partial results are written."

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:121
#: 986f0166e8524380825b72f9fbfc4b2a
msgid "在 Python 脚本里调用"
msgstr "Call It From a Python Script"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:123
#: 7de845815b074b0b9b66bb2e08812c93
msgid "界面和命令行的能力，脚本里都能用。三个入口按需要选一个："
msgstr ""
"Everything the interface and command line can do is available from a "
"script. Pick one of three entry points:"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md
#: 62ca12fad442492999ed0580429e2275
msgid "用途"
msgstr "Goal"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md
#: b3ae10c47bc1457db047d18a42f867d0
msgid "入口"
msgstr "Entry point"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md
#: 90731f3bb26a4f8183f3bc9692fc61f6
msgid "一次跑完，拿到结果"
msgstr "Run once and take the result"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md
#: 6a2a9f5c0927481da8ef63db42a484ca
msgid "`run_workflow(payload, structures)`"
msgstr "`run_workflow(payload, structures)`"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md
#: 6252f2a90ea64b14a4303f9fc6c5cac4
msgid "先看计划、再决定是否执行"
msgstr "Inspect the plan before deciding to run"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md
#: 0a6bde5c11984d12bbff9d43221850cb
msgid "`load_workflow(payload)` 返回的 `WorkflowRun`"
msgstr "The `WorkflowRun` returned by `load_workflow(payload)`"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md
#: eb5340f79eb844e68ad450198b2e09a4
msgid "同一份流程反复跑"
msgstr "Run the same workflow repeatedly"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md
#: 35c8d677c3be4faa99cbd538a02f6705
msgid "复用一个 `WorkflowRun`，省去重复解析"
msgstr ""
"When rerunning in batch, reuse one `load_workflow` result to skip "
"repeated parsing:"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:131
#: 2b7a741dad99490c824a337a08ef8f3f
msgid "`payload` 可以是 JSON 文件路径、JSON 文本，或已经解析好的 dict。"
msgstr ""
"`payload` may be a path to a JSON file, JSON text, or an already parsed "
"dict."

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:133
#: 64c3ca4868e645a8bc48e4c750c4e2c4
msgid "最小例子"
msgstr "Minimal example"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:135
#: 8c8a274073164abbb758e5fa8b0f40e7
msgid ""
"from ase.io import read\n"
"from NepTrainKit.core.workflow import run_workflow\n"
"from NepTrainKit.core.magnetism import prepare_magnetic_extxyz_export\n"
"from ase.io import write\n"
"\n"
"# 读入结构，执行整条流程，取最后一级结果\n"
"structures = read(\"input.xyz\", index=\":\")\n"
"result = run_workflow(\"flow.json\", structures)\n"
"final = result.final()\n"
"\n"
"print(len(final), \"structures\")\n"
"write(\"out.xyz\", [prepare_magnetic_extxyz_export(a) for a in final], "
"format=\"extxyz\")\n"
msgstr ""
"from ase.io import read\n"
"from NepTrainKit.core.workflow import run_workflow\n"
"from NepTrainKit.core.magnetism import prepare_magnetic_extxyz_export\n"
"from ase.io import write\n"
"\n"
"# Read structures, run the whole workflow, take the final stage\n"
"structures = read(\"input.xyz\", index=\":\")\n"
"result = run_workflow(\"flow.json\", structures)\n"
"final = result.final()\n"
"\n"
"print(len(final), \"structures\")\n"
"write(\"out.xyz\", [prepare_magnetic_extxyz_export(a) for a in final], "
"format=\"extxyz\")\n"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:150
#: 33ccb9e0007e481893e6502035f81f36
msgid ""
"`run_workflow` 只负责计算，**不写文件**。要保存时自己写，这样结果可以直接交给后续处理，不必 先落盘再读回来。写 extxyz "
"时用 `prepare_magnetic_extxyz_export` 包装一下，磁矩信息才会正确 写成 extxyz "
"的标准字段，和界面导出的文件一致。"
msgstr ""
"`run_workflow` only computes and **writes no files**. Write them yourself"
" when you need to, so results can flow straight into further processing "
"instead of a disk round trip. When writing extxyz, wrap each structure in"
" `prepare_magnetic_extxyz_export` so magnetic moments land in the "
"standard extxyz fields exactly as the interface export does."

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:154
#: 927b7b665b6a4e26b4f48e2c0b3ba9c6
msgid "先看计划再执行"
msgstr "Inspect the plan before running"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:156
#: 47819a4b92214a81a3b57a6e779aa66e
msgid ""
"from NepTrainKit.core.workflow import load_workflow\n"
"\n"
"run = load_workflow(\"flow.json\")\n"
"\n"
"# 每一步：序号、卡片类名、显示名、类型（structure / dataset / generator / group / fork）\n"
"for stage in run.preview():\n"
"    print(stage.index, stage.card_class, stage.kind)\n"
"\n"
"if run.requires_input():\n"
"    print(\"这条流程需要输入结构\")\n"
msgstr ""
"from NepTrainKit.core.workflow import load_workflow\n"
"\n"
"run = load_workflow(\"flow.json\")\n"
"\n"
"# Each step: index, card class, display label, kind (structure / dataset "
"/ generator / group / fork)\n"
"for stage in run.preview():\n"
"    print(stage.index, stage.card_class, stage.kind)\n"
"\n"
"if run.requires_input():\n"
"    print(\"this workflow needs input structures\")\n"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:169
#: 4ca5c06b86524f6bae6a00e6b4cd71eb
msgid ""
"`preview()` 只解析 JSON，不执行任何卡片。生成型流程（例如原型构建卡）的 `requires_input()` 是 "
"`False`，`run()` 时可以不传结构。"
msgstr ""
"`preview()` only parses the JSON and executes no cards. A generating "
"workflow (such as a prototype builder card) reports `requires_input()` as"
" `False`, and `run()` needs no structures."

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:172
#: 7ef327e50de34e4e90c07580811d0011
msgid "按卡片取结果"
msgstr "Take results per card"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:174
#: 1613e044b9674b94841e1293219f972c
msgid "`WorkflowResult` 保留每一级的输出，不是只有最后一级："
msgstr "`WorkflowResult` keeps every stage's output, not just the final one:"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:176
#: bdedc31f0a904b03bc6483f527d4a4d4
msgid ""
"result = run.run(read(\"input.xyz\", index=\":\"))\n"
"\n"
"result.all()                      # 全部卡片输出拼接在一起（等同命令行默认导出）\n"
"result.final()                     # 最后一级\n"
"\n"
"result.outputs(\"SuperCellCard\")    # 按卡片类名\n"
"result.outputs(index=2)            # 按执行序号，从 1 开始\n"
"\n"
"# 遍历每一级，看清楚数据怎么扩增的\n"
"for output in result.card_outputs:\n"
"    print(output.index, output.card_class, output.input_count, \"->\", "
"len(output))\n"
msgstr ""
"result = run.run(read(\"input.xyz\", index=\":\"))\n"
"\n"
"result.all()                      # every card output concatenated (the "
"CLI default export)\n"
"result.final()                     # the final stage\n"
"\n"
"result.outputs(\"SuperCellCard\")    # by card class name\n"
"result.outputs(index=2)            # by execution index, 1-based\n"
"\n"
"# Walk every stage to see how the data grows\n"
"for output in result.card_outputs:\n"
"    print(output.index, output.card_class, output.input_count, \"->\", "
"len(output))\n"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:190
#: 6e79acda9c3b4f5f868fa67d251c794d
msgid "指定了不存在的卡片或序号时抛 `WorkflowError`，错误信息里会列出所有可用的级别。"
msgstr ""
"An unknown card or index raises `WorkflowError`, and the message lists "
"every available stage."

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:192
#: ffc3dd6c479b49da9efeb545be809765
msgid "只导出某张卡"
msgstr "Export a single card"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:194
#: 908848c2f5d84a68ab371ce50f87b4b8
msgid "想复现 `--card` 的效果，取那一级的结果自己写："
msgstr "To reproduce `--card`, take that stage's result and write it yourself:"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:196
#: e328d1646c9a4f95ab5fc3e1764c4931
msgid ""
"from ase.io import write\n"
"\n"
"structures = read(\"input.xyz\", index=\":\")\n"
"result = run_workflow(\"flow.json\", structures)\n"
"\n"
"write(\"only_supercell.xyz\", result.outputs(\"SuperCellCard\"), "
"format=\"extxyz\")\n"
msgstr ""
"from ase.io import write\n"
"\n"
"structures = read(\"input.xyz\", index=\":\")\n"
"result = run_workflow(\"flow.json\", structures)\n"
"\n"
"write(\"only_supercell.xyz\", result.outputs(\"SuperCellCard\"), "
"format=\"extxyz\")\n"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:205
#: ee4f8ee27ded4a88b9c00eb69e9b5063
msgid "批量重跑"
msgstr "Batch reruns"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:207
#: 1d87c3be1d4944da927f92bc2dfa63bb
msgid "复用同一个 `run` 对象，避免每次都重新解析 JSON："
msgstr "Reuse one `run` object to avoid reparsing the JSON every time:"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:209
#: bb9748fed3f444e69d5da68ad593c52f
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"run = load_workflow(\"flow.json\")\n"
"\n"
"for path in (\"a.xyz\", \"b.xyz\", \"c.xyz\"):\n"
"    structures = read(path, index=\":\")\n"
"    print(path, len(run.run(structures).final()))\n"
msgstr ""
"run = load_workflow(\"flow.json\")\n"
"for path in (\"a.xyz\", \"b.xyz\", \"c.xyz\"):\n"
"    structures = read(path, index=\":\")\n"
"    print(path, len(run.run(structures).final()))\n"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:217
#: 551e28eef80c4eb4b9d14b2ecc924403
msgid "`run.run()` 每次调用都是独立的，不会累积上一次的结果。"
msgstr ""
"Each `run.run()` call is independent and never accumulates the previous "
"result."

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:219
#: c46f76dd92b644448523c2575a0e5827
msgid "在自己的脚本里处理错误"
msgstr "Handle failures in your own script"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:221
#: 465825a30de8451a85d75bb0ce078776
msgid ""
"`WorkflowError` 覆盖 JSON 格式、未知卡片、取不到结果这几类问题；某张卡执行失败时抛的是 "
"`CardOperationError` 子类（例如模型文件不存在是 `FileNotFoundError`）。要一次抓住所有情况："
msgstr ""
"`WorkflowError` covers JSON format problems, unknown cards, and missing "
"results; a failing card raises a `CardOperationError` subclass (a missing"
" model file, for example, is `FileNotFoundError`). To catch everything at"
" once:"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:224
#: ddbc05c368e84060b7568078783c3a98
msgid ""
"from NepTrainKit.core.workflow import WorkflowError, load_workflow\n"
"from NepTrainKit.core.cards.errors import CardOperationError\n"
"\n"
"try:\n"
"    result = load_workflow(\"flow.json\").run(read(\"input.xyz\", "
"index=\":\"))\n"
"except (WorkflowError, CardOperationError) as exc:\n"
"    print(\"workflow failed:\", exc)\n"
msgstr ""
"from NepTrainKit.core.workflow import WorkflowError, load_workflow\n"
"from NepTrainKit.core.cards.errors import CardOperationError\n"
"\n"
"try:\n"
"    result = load_workflow(\"flow.json\").run(read(\"input.xyz\", "
"index=\":\"))\n"
"except (WorkflowError, CardOperationError) as exc:\n"
"    print(\"workflow failed:\", exc)\n"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:234
#: ccf8b824f0e74145845b55d56ea7099a
msgid "与界面执行的差别"
msgstr "Differences From the Interface"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:236
#: 34c12e5459ad4dd5b14e2b05c0d4cbb4
msgid "命令行复现的是同一套卡片逻辑，但以下几点不同："
msgstr "The command line reproduces the same card logic, with these differences:"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:238
#: 017a7359bf994a80a02c9a776619de29
msgid "**不读取软件设置**。界面里的「排序原子」等全局开关不会影响命令行结果。"
msgstr ""
"**Application settings are not read.** Global switches such as \"Sort "
"atoms\" in the interface do not affect command line results."

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:239
#: 72e431583f204b359427d0be3de6abd3
msgid "**不写运行状态**。工作流库只保存配置，命令行同样不产生 `run_outcome` 之类的运行记录。"
msgstr ""
"**No run state is written.** The workflow library stores configuration "
"only, and the command line likewise records nothing like `run_outcome`."

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:240
#: 4f1b1194d5744aaeb97dd8b9b3016966
msgid "**失败即中止**，与界面一致；不会跳过错过的卡片继续执行。"
msgstr ""
"**A failure stops the run**, as in the interface; a failed card is never "
"skipped."

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:242
#: 3501ce1e13da40c8b5e3fa60336ee3e8
msgid "如果命令行结果和界面不一致，先确认两边用的是同一个导出的 JSON，并检查是否依赖了界面里的 全局设置。"
msgstr ""
"If command line results differ from the interface, first confirm both use"
" the same exported JSON, then check for a dependency on interface "
"settings."

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:245
#: 53668eb60863412c99431ead27e75905
msgid "换机器运行时的模型路径"
msgstr "Model Paths When Running on Another Machine"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:247
#: fa1f912bffed4b6fa8358f6357487e4e
msgid "模型路径分两种情况，行为不同。"
msgstr "Model paths behave differently in two cases."

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:249
#: ca03f5e48f314b6ab7cc6e95b6a85a91
msgid "**软件自带的模型（`nep89`）是可移植的。** 导出时不会写死某台机器上的绝对路径，而是写成标记 `bundled:nep89`："
msgstr ""
"**The bundled model (`nep89`) is portable.** The export does not hardcode"
" one machine's absolute path but writes the token `bundled:nep89`:"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:252
#: 41c444d907c84a9b8e011b189592a9b6
#, python-brace-format
msgid "\"params\": { \"nep_path\": \"bundled:nep89\", ... }\n"
msgstr "\"params\": { \"nep_path\": \"bundled:nep89\", ... }\n"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:256
#: e5d7a7d9264844eaa4819f6e4d45ea2b
msgid ""
"运行时会解析成当前机器上真实的模型文件，所以在别的机器、别的安装位置或换了 Python 环境都能 "
"直接跑。界面上显示的仍然是完整路径，标记只存在于数据里。"
msgstr ""
"At run time it resolves to the real model file on the current machine, so"
" it runs directly on another machine, another install location, or a "
"different Python environment. The interface still shows the full path; "
"the token exists only in the data."

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:259
#: d22a8d8d2692494aa37c0e432d6dc185
msgid "**你自己选的模型文件保留绝对路径。** 这类文件只存在于你指定的位置，软件无法替你在别的机器上 找到它，所以原样记录："
msgstr ""
"**A model file you chose keeps its absolute path.** Such a file exists "
"only where you put it and the application cannot find it on another "
"machine, so it is recorded as-is:"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:262
#: 6e4fa67372c4404b971c7ba3ecd7c3bc
#, python-brace-format
msgid "\"params\": { \"nep_path\": \"/opt/models/my_custom.nep\", ... }\n"
msgstr "\"params\": { \"nep_path\": \"/opt/models/my_custom.nep\", ... }\n"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:266
#: 53e98c824089428ab7985146c8dc6f0f
msgid "换机器运行这类工作流时，需要把 `nep_path` 改成目标机器上的真实路径。路径不存在时命令行会明确 报出找不到的文件："
msgstr ""
"To run such a workflow elsewhere, change `nep_path` to a real path on the"
" target machine. When the path does not exist the command line names the "
"missing file:"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:269
#: f9e26b5d478f4460a6cd384a07261c6a
msgid "error: NEP file does not exist: /opt/models/my_custom.nep\n"
msgstr "error: NEP file does not exist: /opt/models/my_custom.nep\n"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:273
#: fb8dd44cf15245d68df60ea368ec222f
msgid ""
"旧版本导出的 JSON 里 `nep_path` 是绝对路径，这类文件仍然可以正常加载；如果你希望它在其他机器 上也能用，把它改成 "
"`bundled:nep89` 即可。"
msgstr ""
"JSON exported by older versions stores an absolute `nep_path`; those "
"files still load normally. To use one on another machine, change it to "
"`bundled:nep89`."

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:276
#: 1bde16f412dc48cf8629ac4a588c771e
msgid "需要知道当前机器上自带模型的真实路径时："
msgstr "To find the bundled model's real path on the current machine:"

#: ../../source/workflows/run-workflow-from-cli.md:278
#: c492e8132cdc45f2bfa4aefeab8208d0
msgid ""
"python -c \"from NepTrainKit.paths import get_bundled_nep89_path; "
"print(get_bundled_nep89_path())\"\n"
msgstr ""
"python -c \"from NepTrainKit.paths import get_bundled_nep89_path; "
"print(get_bundled_nep89_path())\"\n"

